@archive 0003
@size 1

script 0 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"여기가 아스트로 웨이브야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"대단하지 않아, 워록!?\n우주에 있는 웨이브 로드야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"나 같은 AM인에게는\n꽤나 그리운 풍경이군."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"아카츠키 씨는 정말 대단해…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"우주에 가고 싶다는\n내 꿈을 이루어 줬어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"스바루… 네가 신난\n건 알겠지만, 이제\n정말 서둘러야 해."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"여기서 건너가면\n[Area0020]으로\n내려갈 수 있는 곳이 나올 거야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"맞아."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"좋아, [Area0020]에서\n모두를 만나러 가자!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
